# ---------------- PhysPlayer.events (physics movement test) ----------------
# Controls: WASD move, Left Mouse shoot, E push the crate.
# Setup: EventSheet on the PhysPlayer RigidBody, "Use Physics Movement" ON,
# with the BoxCollider and the mesh as children of that body.

when me appears
  set Lives to 3
  set my Invulnerable to false
  set text of LivesLabel to Lives

# ---- movement: drives the kinematic body with a swept AddMovement ----
when W is held
  move forward speed 120

when S is held
  move back speed 120

when A is held
  move left speed 120

when D is held
  move right speed 120

# ---- shooting: the bullet homes on the nearest target (dynamic + CCD) ----
when Left Mouse is pressed
  spawn PhysBullet at me

# ---- push: a real impulse on the dynamic crate ----
when E is pressed
  push PhysCrate up strength 400

# ---- hazard: the spike's trigger volume reports a contact ----
when me touches PhysSpike
  unless my Invulnerable is true
  set my Invulnerable to true
  add -1 to Lives
  wait 1 second
  set my Invulnerable to false

when Lives changes
  set text of LivesLabel to Lives
